<title>USA: Tellabs system picked by Hong Kong Telecom.</title>
<headline>Tellabs system picked by Hong Kong Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Thursday Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd has chosen the company's MartisDXX managed access and transport network system as a platform to deliver managed data services in its new digital data network.</p>
<p>The new network will serve Hongkong Telecom's commercial customers in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Tellabs did not disclose the value of the system order.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
